OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'gentle'
OL,4,Awoman as man charged with murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have paid tribute to a
OL,7,F"gentle" woman who was found dead at a
OL,8,Fresidential property on Saturday.
OL,10,FEleanor O'Dell, 33, was found after
OL,11,Fofficers were called to an address on
OL,12,FSt Seiriol's Road in Llandudno, Conwy,
OL,13,Fshortly after 20:00 GMT on 31 October,
OL,14,Ffollowing reports of a disturbance.
OL,16,FThe family described her as "gentle by
OL,17,Fnature and a ray of sunshine to all",
OL,18,Fadding their "worlds have been crushed
OL,19,Fby the loss of our beautiful girl".
OL,21,F"She has been taken from us and our
OL,22,Fhearts are truly broken," they said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
